WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.950
Lab 1 runs on a laptop.

2
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:06.275
Step one proves every call is
declared: the nine tests pass.

3
00:00:06.275 --> 00:00:09.935
Step two lists what the re-read
client needs on ServiceNow:

4
00:00:09.935 --> 00:00:13.977
a token from its own OAuth client,
then a read of the finding table,

5
00:00:13.977 --> 00:00:16.875
a patch of one record,
and an attachment upload.

6
00:00:16.875 --> 00:00:20.650
Every one of those maps to
a single role, the verifier.

7
00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:23.180
That's the whole of what
this account should hold.
